**Ruled by author 2026-08-22:** no correction scene at B1.CH08. Replaced by Reqa acknowledging that Trav has never once got her name wrong. Shape locked, placement soft, B1.CH08 suggested. Full rule and execution constraints now live in **CAST, Reqa entry**, single authoritative copy.

**Applied this session:** CAST rewritten. BUILD’s SPELLING brief line removed, its explanatory note replaced, its Stage 6 lint check changed to “Reaka in narration = 0,” and its CH.B1.08 worked example corrected. Closes **AUDIT §1.1** by supersession rather than by assigning the scene.

**Still carrying the dead rule, needs a sweep, tracked as DEF-35 below.**

